    "scenesThatPass": [
      "FRY: Somethin' knocked us off-lane. Maybe a rogue comet. Maybe we'll never know.\nSHAZZA: Well, I for one, am thoroughly fucking grateful. This beast wasn't made to land like this. But cripes, you rode it down. C'mon, you lousy in…",
      "FRY: Nothing we can't repair -- so long as the electrical adapts.\nSHAZZA: Not a star-jumper.",
      "FRY: Core-samples are dated. Last one is 60 years ago. This month.\nSHAZZA: Yeah? What's special about that?\nFRY: Dunno. Maybe nothing, but....",
      "FRY: It's starting....\nSHAZZA: If we need anything from the crash ship -- I suggest we kick on. That sand-cat's solar.",
      "FRY: LET'S GET THOSE CELLS!\nSHAZZA: We stay together! C'mon!"
    ]
  },
